[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3]

; A stray cow (scripts/street/cow.gd): a box body, four leg boxes, a head
; and muzzle, a tail and two horns, about 1.4 m tall and 2.2 m long, facing
; -Z. The hide-coloured boxes are one MultiMesh and the horns another, so a
; cow costs two draw calls (docs/BRIEF_AMENDMENT_1.md §C).
; PLACEHOLDER: replaced by the licensed cow model of GDD §10 "Asset sourcing
; plan" ("Licensed packs: ... cows"), painted in the Hollow Vale palette
; (ochre, dust, timber brown). The hide is cloth_pale tinted a dusty cream;
; the horns are the street's timber.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/street/cow.gd" id="1_cow"]
[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/textures/cloth_pale.png" id="2_hide"]
[ext_resource type="Material" path="res://assets/materials/timber.tres" id="3_horn"]

